{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/67e6f0df5635303141cbd1cca0e400a8.avif?t=1769772148\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALVO VR \u2013 Redefining VR Cross\u2011Platform Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high\u2011octane multiplayer shooter built for players who want speed, strategy, and seamless cross\u2011platform action. Whether you\u2019re on PSVR1, PSVR2, Quest, Pico, or SteamVR, ALVO brings everyone together in one shared battlefield. Your headset doesn\u2019t limit you \u2014 it connects you. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six distinct modes, each offering a different style of combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training</strong> \u2013 Hone your skills against AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free\u2011for\u2011All</strong> \u2013 Every player for themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong> \u2013 Classic squad\u2011vs\u2011squad firefights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search and Destroy</strong> \u2013 Tactical, high\u2011stakes objective play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardpoint</strong> \u2013 Hold the zone, control the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zombies</strong> \u2013 Survive waves of the undead with your squad.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALVO is built to adapt to <i>you</i>. Choose between manual or button reloads, customize your HUD elements, and even change the entire UI color theme. Play sitting or standing \u2014 your comfort, your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/216bb262b7021c5f88463629e04a24f4.avif?t=1769772148\" width=1560 height=568 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the ranks to unlock new gear and expand your arsenal. Customize your loadouts with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scopes &amp; reticles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lasers &amp; attachments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon skins</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trinkets &amp; cosmetic upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/f2f96b7a16f09285d7c8aa786fa7e349.poster.avif?t=1769772148\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/f2f96b7a16f09285d7c8aa786fa7e349.webm?t=1769772148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/f2f96b7a16f09285d7c8aa786fa7e349.mp4?t=1769772148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip up to two perks to shape your playstyle. Need more stamina? Extra ammo? A little explosive resistance? Build the advantage that fits your approach to combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/1322b019da3f3b2abb60efdbd6ef681b.webp?t=1769772148\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/1322b019da3f3b2abb60efdbd6ef681b.poster.avif?t=1769772148\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=427 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Killstreaks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn consecutive kills to unleash powerful support options. Trigger different Killstreaks at <strong>3, 5, and 7 kills</strong> to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/7c8d8acc2cde6836a384a795425ceb6a.avif?t=1769772148\" width=1560 height=568 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ALVO features <strong>14 core maps</strong>, with <strong>4 day/night variants</strong> for added variety. From tight urban streets to wide\u2011open outdoor arenas, every map is designed for fast, tactical VR combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/7a5197a54b0ec4c3ac7af90fceccdd32.webp?t=1769772148\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/7a5197a54b0ec4c3ac7af90fceccdd32.poster.avif?t=1769772148\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=427 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enhance the experience even further, ALVO supports <strong>community\u2011made maps</strong>. Expand the fight with custom maps crafted by the community through our private match feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000590/extras/40224bd0f5c4fda3e69e03e1fe3b9aed.avif?t=1769772148\" width=1560 height=568 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ALVO Officer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2000590/2cfc95ca4287c51c8fed2ff8a8f4a8105998118b.jpg"},{"name":"First Deployment","path":"https://cd